Templates that kill the reference process with a Go stack overflow
(fatal error, not recoverable). They never run through hbref; with a
candidate built in, TestRefFatal requires an error from it (render or
limit), not a crash. Contexts are {}.
-- with-in-else.hbs --
{{#if x}}{{else}}{{with a}}{{/if}}
-- if-in-inverse-section.hbs --
{{^x}}{{if a}}{{/x}}
-- unless-in-inverse.hbs --
{{^x}}{{unless t}}{{/x}}
-- each-in-each-else.hbs --
{{#each xs}}{{else}}{{each a}}{{/each}}
-- if-subexpr-in-else.hbs --
{{#if x}}{{else}}{{eq (if a) ""}}{{/if}}
-- with-in-caret.hbs --
{{#if x}}{{^}}{{&with (a)}}{{/if}}
